    <x:String x:Key="General_UILanguage_Title">界面语言</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_UILanguage_Description">选择应用界面显示语言（翻译语言请在翻译窗口中选择）</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Font_Title">界面字体</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Font_Placeholder">输入字体名称</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Font_Description">可选择系统字体，也可输入已安装字体名称；留空使用默认字体</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_DefaultFontFormat">默认字体 ({0})</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Startup_Title">启动</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Startup_StartWithSystem">开机时自动启动 WordLens</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Startup_Unsupported">当前系统不支持自动配置开机自启</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Backup_Title">数据备份</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Backup_Create">备份数据</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Backup_Restore">恢复备份</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Backup_Description">备份包含设置、翻译历史数据库和截图缓存。恢复会覆盖当前数据，并自动创建一份恢复前备份。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Backup_ChooseDestination">请选择备份保存位置...</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Backup_Canceled">已取消备份。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Backup_Running">正在创建备份...</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Backup_DoneFormat">备份完成：{0} 个文件，{1}。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Backup_FailedFormat">备份失败：{0}</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Backup_SaveDialogTitle">保存 WordLens 备份</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Restore_ChooseSource">请选择要恢复的备份文件...</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Restore_Canceled">已取消恢复。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Restore_Running">正在恢复备份...</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Restore_DoneFormat">恢复完成：{0} 个文件。恢复前备份已保存为 {1}。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Restore_FailedFormat">恢复失败：{0}</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Restore_OpenDialogTitle">选择 WordLens 备份</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_LocalApi_Title">本地 API</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_LocalApi_Enable">启用本地自动化 API</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_LocalApi_Port">监听端口</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_LocalApi_Token">访问 Token</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_LocalApi_Description">仅监听 127.0.0.1。外部调用需携带 Authorization: Bearer Token。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Eudic_Title">欧路生词本</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Eudic_Enable">启用欧路词典生词本同步</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Eudic_Token">OpenAPI Token</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Eudic_Language">语言</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Eudic_CategoryId">生词本 ID</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Eudic_Star">星级</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Eudic_Description">Token 可在欧路 OpenAPI 授权页生成；默认生词本 ID 通常为 0。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_PopupPosition_Title">翻译框位置</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_PopupPosition_Description">跟随鼠标会在触发翻译时靠近当前鼠标位置；记住位置会使用上次关闭翻译框时的位置</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Hotkey_Title">快捷键</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Hotkey_SetTranslation">设置快捷键</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Hotkey_SetOcr">设置OCR快捷键</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Hotkey_CapturePlaceholder">请按下快捷键...</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Hotkey_CaptureHintActive">请按下想要设置的快捷键组合（按 ESC 取消）</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Hotkey_CaptureHintIdle">点击按钮后按下想要设置的快捷键组合</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Streaming_Title">流式输出</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Streaming_Enable">启用流式输出（实时显示翻译结果）</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Streaming_EnableTooltip">启用后翻译内容将实时逐步显示，提供更好的用户体验</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Streaming_Delay">打字机效果延迟（毫秒）</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Streaming_DelayTooltip">每个字符显示之间的延迟时间</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Streaming_DelayDescription">0 = 无延迟，实时显示；推荐值：30-50毫秒</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Streaming_Chars">每次显示字符数</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Streaming_CharsTooltip">一次性显示的字符数量</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Streaming_CharsDescription">1 = 逐字显示；较大值可加快显示速度</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="General_Streaming_Description">提示：流式输出可以让翻译过程更加流畅，但如果网络不稳定可以关闭此功能</x:String>
